  "Id": 2902,
  "Title": "What Is Islamic Studies? by Professors Leif Stenberg and Philip Wood",
  "NewsSubTitle": "AKU-ISMC Publications",
  "NewsSummary": "AKU-ISMC's Leif Stenberg and Philip Wood discuss their new book.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Professors Leif Stenberg and Philip Wood discuss their new book "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What is Islamic Studies?",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.aku.edu/ismc/publications/Pages/emc.aspx",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "linktype": "url",
                  "uuid": null,
                  "anchor": null,
                  "custom": {}
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "italic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", examining the state of the discipline and demonstrating why the essays in the book are essential reading for the non-essentialist scholar of Islamic studies."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Leif Stenberg",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.aku.edu/ismc/people/Pages/leif-stenberg.aspx",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "linktype": "url",
                  "uuid": null,
                  "anchor": null,
                  "custom": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is Dean and Professor of Islamic Studies at the Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations (AKU-ISMC). Between 2010 and 2019 Stenberg was President of the Nordic Society of Middle Eastern Studies and he is currently a member of the World Congress of Middle Eastern Studies (WOCMES) Council and vice-president of the European Association for Middle Eastern Studies (EURAMES)."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Philip Wood ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.aku.edu/ismc/people/Pages/philip-wood.aspx",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "linktype": "url",
                  "uuid": null,
                  "anchor": null,
                  "custom": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "is Professor of History at AKU-ISMC. His research focuses on Christians and Muslims in the Middle East c500-1000 and he is particularly interested the role of history-writing and hagiography in reflecting and asserting social boundaries."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
